---
// About section
---

<section class="about-section" id="about">
  <div class="about-container reveal">
    <span class="section-label">About Us</span>
    <h2 class="section-title">Hey, we're Meg & Ryker 👋</h2>
    <p class="about-text">
      We packed up our lives in <em>Seattle</em>, quit our jobs, and set off to spend a year exploring the world.
      From Muay Thai in Thailand to volcano hiking in Bali, we're chasing adventure, eating everything in sight,
      and writing about the chaos along the way. Follow along — it only gets wilder from here.
    </p>
    <div class="about-names">the Coreys — est. 2025</div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .about-section {
    padding: 6rem 2rem;
    background: var(--cream);
  }

  .about-container {
    max-width: 900px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    text-align: center;
  }

  .about-text {
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    font-size: clamp(1.2rem, 2.5vw, 1.8rem);
    line-height: 1.7;
    color: rgba(0,0,0,0.7);
    margin-bottom: 2rem;
  }

  .about-text em {
    color: var(--coral);
    font-style: italic;
  }

  .about-names {
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 0.8rem;
    letter-spacing: 0.3em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: rgba(0,0,0,0.3);
  }
</style>
